 12.\tab DEC\par
\par
\tab DEC is the usual abbreviation of \ul\i Digital Equipment Corporation\ulnone\i0 ,\par
\tab the company that created the PDP-8\sub 99\nosupersub  and other computers.\par
\par
\tab Note: If you are not already familiar with this information, you\par
